    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1a544888-cbb8-360f-897a-d98fd8366c6a",
                "word": "Brexiteer",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "56104b7c-e9bf-4d8c-8bdc-abac50101d97",
                        "entry_id": "1a544888-cbb8-360f-897a-d98fd8366c6a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Brexiteers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ccda47a2-0977-394d-95dd-4fe6d970e10b",
                        "entry_id": "1a544888-cbb8-360f-897a-d98fd8366c6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who supports Brexit, the United Kingdom's exit from the European Union."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6833cda5-3dde-4c02-972b-db906b1381da",
                                "sense_id": "ccda47a2-0977-394d-95dd-4fe6d970e10b",
                                "text": "After Ken Clarke's \"Charge of Light Brigade\" hit on Brexiteers in @Daily_Telegraph, Defra SoS likened to Lord Raglan in #CAP reform debate"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c30b9c65-72be-45ad-81c2-eda5839d1cee",
                                "sense_id": "ccda47a2-0977-394d-95dd-4fe6d970e10b",
                                "text": "Whether you are a Europhile or a Brexiteer, it’s hard to see what’s not to like about a market-driven initiative that aims to pull down barriers to more investment across Europe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44d2c085-68a1-45b3-a721-80e9617a92ff",
                                "sense_id": "ccda47a2-0977-394d-95dd-4fe6d970e10b",
                                "text": "Denying he [David Cameron] was a \"closet Brexiteer\", as his former aide Steve Hilton has claimed, the PM told reporters: \"I withdraw absolutely nothing I've previously said. Britain is an amazing country. We can find our way whatever the British people choose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03d43c9e-84bc-4142-869c-041459f9e10f",
                                "sense_id": "ccda47a2-0977-394d-95dd-4fe6d970e10b",
                                "text": "A leading Tory Brexiteer has insisted quitting the EU does not mean the numbers of people coming to Britain will be slashed – and claimed Vote Leave never said it would."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6699e3b-8e09-4534-bb09-14028c7cb4eb",
                                "sense_id": "ccda47a2-0977-394d-95dd-4fe6d970e10b",
                                "text": "For Brexiteers in the UK, a free trade deal with the US was one of several promises made before and after the 2016 referendum that have failed to come to fruition."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54b05ba8-4b4f-4d8b-a54d-bcb961804c66",
                                "sense_id": "ccda47a2-0977-394d-95dd-4fe6d970e10b",
                                "text": "[Margaret] Thatcher was no Brexiteer. She was a strong supporter of the Single Market and thought that the [Channel] tunnel would help cement it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0df9f86a-454f-3b04-a7aa-989b13dd9ba5",
                        "entry_id": "1a544888-cbb8-360f-897a-d98fd8366c6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Usually in plural: a holder of any of the posts in the British Cabinet tasked with negotiating the country's exit from the European Union."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9e96eba-4a8f-480c-9d61-50f3a48c653e",
                                "sense_id": "0df9f86a-454f-3b04-a7aa-989b13dd9ba5",
                                "text": "Completing the Three Brexiteers is Boris Johnson, the UK's new Foreign Secretary."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cccdb83-8bdb-4669-b3d4-9650449765b4",
                                "sense_id": "0df9f86a-454f-3b04-a7aa-989b13dd9ba5",
                                "text": "For newspapers with only the Olympics to write about during August, the squabbling \"Three Brexiteers\" – the senior ministers supposedly tasked with executing the will of the British people to remove us from the European Union – came as a gift."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8909485-7a92-4b23-9b45-b71b4ba0d816",
                                "sense_id": "0df9f86a-454f-3b04-a7aa-989b13dd9ba5",
                                "text": "She [British Prime Minister Theresa May] urges people to get behind the team of ministers working for Brexit: David Davis, Liam Fox, Priti Patel and Boris Johnson. (It seems Patel has now been co-opted as a fourth Brexiteer.)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "53ec5fce-eb61-4553-9e6a-1be8bc405980",
                                "sense_id": "0df9f86a-454f-3b04-a7aa-989b13dd9ba5",
                                "text": "That was until she announced that Boris Johnson would have to share Chevening, the foreign secretary’s grace-and-favour country retreat, with his fellow cabinet Brexiteers, David Davis and Liam Fox."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b817d88-4247-4aba-a3ee-9853eb3c4dad",
                                "sense_id": "0df9f86a-454f-3b04-a7aa-989b13dd9ba5",
                                "text": "It's worth remembering all the Three Brexiteers, who campaigned to Leave, are still in place."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "623f034e-6ad5-4070-8c12-678036a48d12",
                                "sense_id": "0df9f86a-454f-3b04-a7aa-989b13dd9ba5",
                                "text": "At the moment, our future is being decided by Theresa May’s desperate attempts to remain as prime minister (and to do this she has to kowtow to the wishes of the three Brexiteers Boris Johnson, David Davis, and Jacob Rees-Mogg). The future, therefore, is not being decided by us."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
